---
import '../../../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Your life. Your voice. Your book." />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Prufrock | NorthWoods Sentinel" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Your life. Your voice. Your book." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <title>Prufrock | NorthWoods Sentinel</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400;1,600&family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-T97366J39P"></script>
    <script>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', 'G-T97366J39P');
    </script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Prufrock",
      "description": "Transform boxes of physical family artifacts — letters, journals, photographs, margin notes, negatives, home videos — into searchable digital archives, memoir scaffolds, and AI writing companions.",
      "url": "https://northwoodssentinel.com/flowlabs/prufrock/",
      "provider": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "NorthWoods Sentinel",
        "url": "https://northwoodssentinel.com"
      },
      "serviceType": ["Memoir Writing Service", "Document Digitization", "Family Archive", "Voice Profiling", "AI Writing Companion"],
      "areaServed": "US",
      "hasOfferCatalog": {
        "@type": "OfferCatalog",
        "name": "Prufrock Service Tiers",
        "itemListElement": [
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "The Archive",
            "description": "Everything digitized, transcribed, tagged, cataloged, and searchable. Timeline of family history. Physical materials returned safely."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "The Story",
            "description": "The Archive plus narrative thread analysis and walkthrough session. Connections between documents found by AI."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "The Companion",
            "description": "The Story plus a custom AI writing partner configured with your archive, timeline, family, and voice. Write your memoir by talking."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>

    <!-- Fog layers -->
    <div class="fog fog-1"></div>
    <div class="fog fog-2"></div>

    <!-- Lamp glow -->
    <div class="lamp"></div>

    <nav class="prufrock-nav">
      <a href="/">NorthWoods Sentinel</a>
      <span class="nav-sep">·</span>
      <a href="/flowlabs">FlowLabs</a>
    </nav>

    <main class="prufrock-page">

      <header>
        <h1>Prufrock</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="epigraph">
        <p>
          Let us go then, you and I,<br/>
          When the evening is spread out against the sky<br/>
          Like a patient etherised upon a table
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">

        <section class="stanza">
          <p>
            There is a box in your attic, or your garage, or a storage unit
            you pay for every month and never visit.
          </p>
          <p>
            Inside it are letters in handwriting you recognize
            but haven't seen in years. Photographs of people whose names
            you're starting to forget. A journal you kept during the worst
            year of your life. Your mother's recipe cards. Your father's
            margin notes in a book you didn't know he read.
          </p>
          <p>
            You have thought, more than once, about throwing it away.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="question">
          Who would care?
        </div>

        <section class="stanza">
          <p>
            And in that question lives the same hesitation Prufrock felt —
            the measuring out of a life in coffee spoons, the quiet certainty
            that the story isn't worth telling, that the universe doesn't need
            disturbing, that the peach should remain uneaten.
          </p>
          <p class="answer">
            But you would be wrong.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Divider: window illustration -->
        <div class="window-scene">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="window-svg">
            <!-- Window frame -->
            <rect x="120" y="20" width="160" height="160" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="200" y1="20" x2="200" y2="180" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <line x1="120" y1="100" x2="280" y2="100" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <!-- Warm glow through glass -->
            <rect x="121" y="21" width="78" height="78" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.08"/>
            <rect x="201" y="21" width="78" height="78" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.06"/>
            <rect x="121" y="101" width="78" height="78" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.05"/>
            <rect x="201" y="101" width="78" height="78" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.07"/>
            <!-- Fog outside -->
            <ellipse cx="60" cy="120" rx="80" ry="40" fill="var(--fog-color)" opacity="0.15"/>
            <ellipse cx="340" cy="80" rx="70" ry="35" fill="var(--fog-color)" opacity="0.12"/>
            <!-- Lamp inside -->
            <circle cx="165" cy="65" r="8" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.4"/>
            <circle cx="165" cy="65" r="15" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.1"/>
            <circle cx="165" cy="65" r="25" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.05"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <section class="stanza">
          <h2>Ship me the boxes.</h2>
          <p>
            I photograph every page, every letter, every margin note. I scan
            the negatives and the prints. I digitize the home videos.
          </p>
          <p>
            Everything is transcribed — the handwriting your father scratched
            into the margins of a recovery book at 3 AM, the recipe your mother
            wrote on the back of an envelope, the journal entry you wrote
            the day you got sober.
          </p>
          <p>
            The AI reads what they wrote. It finds the dates they mentioned,
            the people they named, the places they went. It clusters the faces
            in your photographs. It builds a timeline that spans decades.
            It finds threads between documents that were in separate boxes
            in separate rooms — connections you couldn't see because the pieces
            were never in the same place before.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="stanza">
          <h2>Then we talk.</h2>
          <p>
            I show you what the pipeline found. I show you the faces and
            you tell me their names. And in the telling — in the moment
            you say <em>"that's Uncle Jerry, he was the one who..."</em> —
            you start remembering things you forgot you knew.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm listening. I'm recording. Your voice — the way you actually
            sound when you talk about the people you loved — becomes the
            raw material for everything that follows.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Divider: coffee spoons -->
        <div class="spoons">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="spoons-svg">
            <line x1="80" y1="20" x2="140" y2="20" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4"/>
            <ellipse cx="148" cy="20" rx="8" ry="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4"/>
            <line x1="170" y1="20" x2="230" y2="20" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4"/>
            <ellipse cx="238" cy="20" rx="8" ry="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4"/>
            <line x1="260" y1="20" x2="320" y2="20" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <section class="stanza tiers">
          <h2>Three tiers, each builds on the last</h2>

          <a href="/flowlabs/prufrock/archive/" target="_blank" class="tier-link">
            <div class="tier">
              <div class="tier-header">
                <h3>The Archive</h3>
                <span class="tier-label">Tier 1</span>
              </div>
              <p>
                Everything digitized, transcribed, tagged, and searchable.
                A timeline of your family. Your physical materials returned
                safely.
              </p>
              <span class="tier-arrow">Learn more →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/flowlabs/prufrock/story/" target="_blank" class="tier-link">
            <div class="tier">
              <div class="tier-header">
                <h3>The Story</h3>
                <span class="tier-label">Tier 2 — includes The Archive</span>
              </div>
              <p>
                Everything in The Archive, plus the threads you couldn't see
                when they lived in separate boxes. A walkthrough session
                where we map the memoir together.
              </p>
              <span class="tier-arrow">Learn more →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/flowlabs/prufrock/companion/" target="_blank" class="tier-link">
            <div class="tier">
              <div class="tier-header">
                <h3>The Companion</h3>
                <span class="tier-label">Tier 3 — includes The Archive + The Story</span>
              </div>
              <p>
                Everything in The Story, plus an AI writing partner that
                sounds like you. You talk. It writes. No blank page.
              </p>
              <span class="tier-arrow">Learn more →</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </section>

        <section class="stanza fidelity">
          <p>
            Prufrock also scores AI-assisted writing for voice fidelity —
            the original question that started this. <em>Does this sound
            like you?</em> Consultants, lawyers, anyone who sends
            AI-generated writing under their own name.
            <a href="/essays/2026-03-20-your-ai-sounds-like-nowhere">The origin story.</a>
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Divider: the stair -->
        <div class="stair-scene">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="stair-svg">
            <line x1="160" y1="110" x2="160" y2="90" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="160" y1="90" x2="180" y2="90" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="180" y1="90" x2="180" y2="70" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="180" y1="70" x2="200" y2="70" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="200" y1="70" x2="200" y2="50" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="200" y1="50" x2="220" y2="50" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="220" y1="50" x2="220" y2="30" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="220" y1="30" x2="240" y2="30" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="240" y1="30" x2="240" y2="10" stroke="var(--brass)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.3"/>
            <!-- Small figure at bottom -->
            <circle cx="155" cy="107" r="3" fill="var(--amber)" opacity="0.3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <section class="stanza origin">
          <p>
            I built this because I found my dead father's recovery book
            in a box I almost threw away. He had written in the margins
            for eight years — tracking my life, noting the weather, logging
            his cancer treatments, writing my name into his prayers.
          </p>
          <p>
            On his amends list, my name was first.
          </p>
          <p>
            I didn't know any of that until I photographed the pages
            and let the machine read what he wrote.
          </p>
          <p class="answer">
            The boxes in your attic are not junk.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <footer class="prufrock-footer">
        <div class="cta">
          <a href="mailto:robert@northwoodssentinel.com?subject=Prufrock">Get in touch</a>
          <span class="nav-sep">·</span>
          <a href="https://substack.com/@chewvala">Substack</a>
        </div>
        <p class="closing">
          <em>Do I dare<br/>disturb the universe?</em>
        </p>
        <p class="dare">Yes.</p>
      </footer>

    </main>

    <style>
      :root {
        --amber: #c9a55a;
        --brass: #a08050;
        --fog-color: #8a8070;
        --parchment: #f5f0e8;
        --parchment-dark: #1a1612;
        --ink: #2c2418;
        --ink-muted: #6b5d4d;
        --ink-faint: #9a8b78;
        --lamp-glow: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      }

      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        background-color: var(--parchment-dark);
        color: var(--parchment);
        font-family: 'EB Garamond', 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.85;
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        position: relative;
      }

      /* Fog animation layers */
      .fog {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: -50%;
        width: 200%;
        height: 100%;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }

      .fog-1 {
        background: linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          transparent 0%,
          rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.015) 20%,
          transparent 40%,
          rgba(138, 128, 112, 0.02) 60%,
          transparent 80%
        );
        animation: drift 60s linear infinite;
      }

      .fog-2 {
        background: linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          transparent 10%,
          rgba(138, 128, 112, 0.02) 30%,
          transparent 50%,
          rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.01) 70%,
          transparent 90%
        );
        animation: drift 90s linear infinite reverse;
      }

      @keyframes drift {
        from { transform: translateX(0); }
        to { transform: translateX(50%); }
      }

      /* Lamp glow at top */
      .lamp {
        position: fixed;
        top: -200px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 800px;
        height: 600px;
        background: radial-gradient(
          ellipse at center,
          rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.06) 0%,
          rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.02) 40%,
          transparent 70%
        );
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }

      /* Nav */
      .prufrock-nav {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;
        padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      .prufrock-nav a {
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .prufrock-nav a:hover { color: var(--amber); }

      .nav-sep {
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        margin: 0 0.5rem;
        opacity: 0.4;
      }

      /* Main content */
      .prufrock-page {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 2rem 6rem;
      }

      /* Header */
      header {
        margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
        text-align: center;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 4.5rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--amber);
        text-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.15);
      }

      /* Epigraph */
      .epigraph {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 4rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 2;
      }

      /* Content sections */
      .stanza {
        margin: 3rem 0;
      }

      .stanza p {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--parchment);
        opacity: 0.88;
      }

      .stanza h2 {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--amber);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }

      .stanza h3 {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--brass);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      }

      /* The question */
      .question {
        text-align: center;
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        margin: 3rem 0;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }

      .answer {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--amber) !important;
        opacity: 1 !important;
      }

      /* Tiers */
      .tier-link {
        text-decoration: none;
        display: block;
      }

      .tier {
        margin: 2rem 0;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-left: 2px solid rgba(160, 128, 80, 0.2);
        border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
        transition: border-color 0.3s, background-color 0.3s;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .tier:hover {
        border-left-color: var(--amber);
        background-color: rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.04);
      }

      .tier-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: baseline;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      .tier-label {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
      }

      .tier-arrow {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--brass);
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.3s;
      }

      .tier:hover .tier-arrow {
        opacity: 1;
      }

      .tier p {
        color: var(--parchment);
        opacity: 0.8;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      /* Fidelity section */
      .fidelity {
        padding: 2rem 0;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(160, 128, 80, 0.15);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(160, 128, 80, 0.15);
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
      }

      .fidelity a {
        color: var(--amber);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        text-decoration-color: rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.3);
      }

      .fidelity a:hover {
        text-decoration-color: var(--amber);
      }

      /* SVG illustrations */
      .window-scene, .spoons, .stair-scene {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: 3rem 0;
      }

      .window-svg { width: 280px; }
      .spoons-svg { width: 300px; }
      .stair-svg { width: 250px; }

      /* Origin section */
      .origin {
        margin-top: 3rem;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .prufrock-footer {
        margin-top: 5rem;
        text-align: center;
        padding-top: 3rem;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(160, 128, 80, 0.15);
      }

      .cta {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
      }

      .cta a {
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        text-decoration-color: rgba(160, 128, 80, 0.3);
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .cta a:hover { color: var(--amber); }

      .closing {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        line-height: 2;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      .dare {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--amber);
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(201, 165, 90, 0.2);
      }

      /* Links */
      a { color: var(--amber); }
      em { color: var(--ink-faint); font-style: italic; }
      .stanza em { color: inherit; opacity: 0.9; }

      /* Mobile */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .prufrock-page { padding: 1rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
        .question { font-size: 1.4rem; }
        .epigraph { font-size: 0.9rem; }
        header { margin: 2rem 0 1.5rem; }
      }
    </style>

  </body>
</html>
